    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASTRO AMIGO</strong> is a heartfelt, sci-fi adventure where a bullied kid stumbles into a cosmic mystery after his beloved dog, Amigo, goes missing. With summer break just days away, can he save his best friend before it\u2019s too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/extras/1d1155a1218ef9d8ea6c24ea577af597.poster.avif?t=1750961382\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/extras/1d1155a1218ef9d8ea6c24ea577af597.webm?t=1750961382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/extras/1d1155a1218ef9d8ea6c24ea577af597.mp4?t=1750961382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOSTALGIC STORY SHAPED BY YOUR CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow the dust off a lost '90s cartridge and dive into a story full of mystery, heart, and throwback thrills. Your choices shape the story\u2014twisting fates, discovering secrets, and unlocking one of multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PACKED WITH RETRO MINI-GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a choose-your-adventure story\u2014it\u2019s a blast of \u201890s gameplay nostalgia. Quirky mini-games full of charm: bike chases, dodgeball battles, late-night alien spotting,  fetch with your four-legged best friend, Amigo, and much more! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich, supernatural story shaped by the choices you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi adventure gameplay full of nostalgic charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with quirky retro mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn pixel art paired with an endearing original synth soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feels like it was unearthed from a 1992 time capsule.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovingly crafted by a passionate two-person team.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming this summer.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ASTRO AMIGO</strong> is a heartfelt, sci-fi adventure where a bullied kid stumbles into a cosmic mystery after his beloved dog, Amigo, goes missing. With summer break just days away, can he save his best friend before it\u2019s too late?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/extras/1d1155a1218ef9d8ea6c24ea577af597.poster.avif?t=1750961382\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/extras/1d1155a1218ef9d8ea6c24ea577af597.webm?t=1750961382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3577850/extras/1d1155a1218ef9d8ea6c24ea577af597.mp4?t=1750961382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NOSTALGIC STORY SHAPED BY YOUR CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blow the dust off a lost '90s cartridge and dive into a story full of mystery, heart, and throwback thrills. Your choices shape the story\u2014twisting fates, discovering secrets, and unlocking one of multiple endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PACKED WITH RETRO MINI-GAMES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t just a choose-your-adventure story\u2014it\u2019s a blast of \u201890s gameplay nostalgia. Quirky mini-games full of charm: bike chases, dodgeball battles, late-night alien spotting,  fetch with your four-legged best friend, Amigo, and much more! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich, supernatural story shaped by the choices you make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sci-fi adventure gameplay full of nostalgic charm.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Packed with quirky retro mini-games.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings to uncover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn pixel art paired with an endearing original synth soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feels like it was unearthed from a 1992 time capsule.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lovingly crafted by a passionate two-person team.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coming this summer.</p>",
